{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/costa-mare-ellington-properties-al-marjan-island","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1088,"crm_id":"4464","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Costa Mare","slug":"costa-mare-ellington-properties-al-marjan-island","display_address":"Al Marjan Island","building_type":["apartment","penthouse","villa"],"completion_year":"2028","developer":"Ellington Properties","price":2700000,"display_price":"2.7M","lattitude":25.6081775,"longitude":55.6247346,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":6,"display_bedrooms":"1,2,3,4,6","about":"<p>Costa Mare by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-ellington-properties/\">Ellington </a>at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/al-marjan-island/\">Al Marjan Island</a> is an ultra-luxurious waterfront residential development, featuring over 900 meticulously designed homes, including <strong>1 to 4-bedroom apartments, exclusive beach villas, and a six-bedroom penthouse.</strong> Spanning four iconic towers, this masterfully planned project offers a breathtaking island lifestyle with stunning sea views, expansive living spaces, and seamless indoor-outdoor connectivity. With private beach access, residents can experience an unparalleled blend of tranquility and sophistication in one of the UAE’s most sought-after coastal destinations.</p><p>Strategically located, Costa Mare at Al Marjan Island is just a short walk from the iconic Wynn Casino, world-class resorts, and vibrant entertainment hubs. The master plan of Costa Mare includes three interconnected buildings and one standalone tower, with an expansive 12,000 sq. ft. floor area per level. Costa Mare Al Marjan Island amenities elevate luxury living with five pools (indoor &amp; outdoor), hanging sky amenities, a wellness spa, a Pilates studio, a clubhouse, a private cinema, and more, making Ellington Costa Mare the epitome of resort-style living.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Costa_Mare_by_Ellington_at_Al_Marjan_Island_5fa51f9764.jpg","hash":"Costa_Mare_by_Ellington_at_Al_Marjan_Island_5fa51f9764","name":"Costa Mare by Ellington at Al Marjan Island"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Costa_Mare_by_Ellington_at_Al_Marjan_Island_c84bf28d13.jpg","hash":"Costa_Mare_by_Ellington_at_Al_Marjan_Island_c84bf28d13","name":"Costa Mare by Ellington at Al Marjan Island"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/costa_mare_g_14_06a4b6d325.jpg","hash":"costa_mare_g_14_06a4b6d325","name":"costa-mare-g-14.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/costa_mare_g_8_c14fa05792.jpg","hash":"costa_mare_g_8_c14fa05792","name":"costa-mare-g-8.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/costa_mare_g_10_22f6a49b49.jpg","hash":"costa_mare_g_10_22f6a49b49","name":"costa-mare-g-10.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/costa_mare_g_6_a745a25089.jpg","hash":"costa_mare_g_6_a745a25089","name":"costa-mare-g-6.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/costa_mare_g_12_ef810a8b37.jpg","hash":"costa_mare_g_12_ef810a8b37","name":"costa-mare-g-12.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Costa_Mare_by_Ellington_at_Al_Marjan_Island_d65b71b2c7.jpg","hash":"Costa_Mare_by_Ellington_at_Al_Marjan_Island_d65b71b2c7","name":"Costa Mare by Ellington at Al Marjan Island"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/costa_mare_g_1_c52532c2b0.jpg","hash":"costa_mare_g_1_c52532c2b0","name":"costa-mare-g-1.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/cost