h-end finishes.</li><li>Resort-Style Amenities – Includes 5 pools (indoor &amp; outdoor), a wellness spa, Pilates studio, club house, private cinema, and sky-hanging amenities.</li><li>Strategic Location – Minutes away from Wynn Casino, luxury hotels, world-class resorts, fine dining, and entertainment hubs.</li><li>Master-Planned Community – Four towers, three interconnected buildings, and one standalone tower, spanning 12,000 sqft per floor.</li><li>Unparalleled Connectivity – Easy access to RAK Central (9 mins), Al Hamra Golf Club (10 mins), and RAK Airport (30 mins).</li><li>Tranquil Yet Vibrant Environment – Designed for modern island living with lush landscapes, jogging trails, and serene waterfront spaces.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1371,"cta":{"id":2145,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Costa_Mare_by_Ellington_at_Al_Marjan_Island_bb79d9373c.jpg","hash":"Costa_Mare_by_Ellington_at_Al_Marjan_Island_bb79d9373c","name":"Costa Mare by Ellington at Al Marjan Island"},"style":null,"title":"Costa Mare: Where Island Serenity Meets Urban Luxury in Al Marjan Island.","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Costa Mare by Ellington at Al Marjan Island is a waterfront residential development by Ellington Properties, set in Ras Al Khaimah’s first man-made archipelago. This iconic destination comprises four interconnected coral-shaped islands, offering a perfect blend of seafront tranquility and urban convenience. The master plan of Costa Mare is designed for an upscale lifestyle, surrounded by pristine beaches, lush parks, jogging trails, and waterfront promenades. Ideally located near the Wynn Casino, world-class resorts, luxury hotels, and fine dining, Ellington Costa Mare provides residents with an exclusive island retreat enriched with premium leisure and lifestyle amenities.</p><ul><li>Wynn Resort – 2 minutes</li><li>Al Hamra Mall – 12 minutes</li><li>RAK Central – 13 minutes</li><li>Al Hamra Golf Club – 14 minutes</li><li>RAK Track – 16 minutes</li><li>Royal Yacht Club of Ras Al Khaimah – 20 minutes</li><li>RAK Mall – 30 minutes</li><li>Al Qawasim Corniche &amp; RAK Eye – 30 minutes</li></ul>","design_title":null},"brochure":{"id":3702,"url":null,"file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":2424,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":3284,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"1 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":3285,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"2 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":3286,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"3 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":3287,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"4 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":3288,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"6 Bedroom Penthouses","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":3289,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"Beach Villas","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null}],"payment_plan_text":"70/30","payment_plans":[{"id":9773,"title":"20%","description":"On Booking"},{"id":9774,"title":"50%","description":"During Construction"},{"id":9775,"title":"30%","description":"On Completion"}],"community":"Al Marjan Island","publish":1,"currency":"AED","amenities":[{"id":22155,"url":null,"text":"Drop-Off Area","type":null,"im