s, and high-end lifestyle facilities.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What amenities are available at Costa Mare Al Marjan Island?"},{"id":5406,"answer":"<p>Costa Mare at Al Marjan Island is strategically located in Ras Al Khaimah, minutes away from Wynn Casino (4 mins), RAK Central (9 mins), Al Hamra Golf Club (10 mins), Royal Yacht Club (12 mins), and RAK Airport (30 mins).<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Where is Costa Mare located, and what are nearby landmarks?"},{"id":5407,"answer":"<p>The prime waterfront location, proximity to Wynn Casino, resort-style amenities, and high rental demand make Costa Mare by Ellington Properties a highly profitable real estate investment with strong ROI potential.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What makes Costa Mare a great investment opportunity?"},{"id":5408,"answer":"<p>Yes, Ellington Costa Mare offers flexible payment plans, making it easier for investors and homeowners to secure a unit in this prestigious development. Specific details will be announced soon.</p>","question":"Are there flexible payment plans available for Costa Mare?"}],"virtual_tour_url":null,"permit_number":null,"country":"Dubai","documents":null,"future_launch":"Future Launch","adroll":0,"ggfx_results":[{"src_url":"i/Costa_Mare_by_Ellington_at_Al_Marjan_Island_7688773c93.jpg","src_cftle":"i/Costa_Mare_by_Ellington_at_Al_Marjan_Island_7688773c93.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/1300x500/Costa_Mare_by_Ellington_at_Al_Marjan_Island_7688773c93.webp","format":"webp","transform":"1300x500","created_at":"2025-02-19 13:12:23.084","updated_at":"2025-02-19 13:12:41.156"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/416x600/Costa_Mare_by_Ellington_at_Al_Marjan_Island_7688773c93.webp","format":"webp","transform":"416x600","created_at":"2025-02-19 13:12:28.296","updated_at":"2025-02-19 13:12:41.156"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/600x/Costa_Mare_by_Ellington_at_Al_Marjan_Isl